hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1380","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Baqi mein ek shakhs ne pukara: Ae Abu al-Qasim! Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf tawajjah farmayi. To us ne kaha: Main ne tumhe nahi pukara. Aap ne farmaya: Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho."
"1381","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se ek mard ke haan ladka paida hua. Phir us ne us ka naam Qasim rakha. To Ansar ne kaha: Hum tumhe Abu al-Qasim kuniyat nahi denge, na tumhe aankh ki thandak denge. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Mere haan ladka paida hua hai. Phir main ne us ka naam Qasim rakha. Phir Ansar ne kaha: Hum tumhe Abu al-Qasim kuniyat nahi denge, na tumhe aankh ki thandak denge. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ansar ne acha kiya. Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho. Kyunke main to taqseem karne wala hun."
"1382","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se ek mard ke haan ladka paida hua. Phir us ne us ka naam Qasim rakha. Phir hum ne kaha: Hum tumhe Abu al-Qasim kuniyat nahi denge, na izzat. Phir Aap ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne bete ka naam Abd al-Rahman rakho."
"1383","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho."
"1384","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Zainab ka naam Barra tha. Phir kaha gaya ke wo apne aap ko paak karti hai. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka naam Zainab rakha."
"1385","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se zaleel naam wo mard hai jo badshahon ke badshah se naam rakhe."
"1386","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha ka beta beemar tha. Phir Abu Talha nikle. Phir bachcha faut ho gaya. Phir jab Abu Talha laute to unhon ne kaha: Mere bete ne kya kiya? To Umm Sulaim ne kaha: Wo sab se pur-sukoon hai jo tha. Phir unhon ne un ke paas raat ka khana rakha. Phir unhon ne raat ka khana khaya. Phir un se mile. Phir jab farigh hue to unhon ne kaha: Bachche ko dafan karo. Phir jab Abu Talha ne subah ki to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne aaj raat dulha bane? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Un dono ko barkat de. Phir un ke haan ladka paida hua. Abu Talha ne mujh se kaha: Use hifazat se rakho yahan tak ke use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas lao. Phir use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye. Aur unhon ne us ke sath khajoorein bhejein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use liya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya us ke sath kuchh hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, khajoorein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe liya aur chabaya. Phir apne munh se lekar bachche ke munh mein rakha. Aur use ghutti di. Aur us ka naam Abdullah rakha."
"1387","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere haan ladka paida hua. Phir main use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya. Phir Aap ne us ka naam Ibrahim rakha. Phir use khajoor se ghutti di. Aur us ke liye barkat ki dua farmayi. Aur use mujhe de diya. Aur wo Abu Musa ki aulad mein sab se bade they."
"1388","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Abdullah bin al-Zubair se hamla thin. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main nikli jabke main poore dinon se thi. Phir Madina aayi. Phir Quba mein utri. Phir use Quba mein jana. Phir use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas layi. Phir use Aap ki god mein rakha. Phir Aap ne khajoor mangwayi aur use chabaya. Phir us ke munh mein thooka. Phir sab se pehli cheez jo us ke pet mein dakhil hui Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka luaab tha. Phir use khajoor se ghutti di. Phir us ke liye dua farmayi aur barkat di. Aur wo pehla bachcha tha jo Islam mein paida hua."
"1389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mundhir bin Abi Usaid Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye gaye jab paida hue. Phir Aap ne use apni raan par rakha, jabke Abu Usaid baithe they. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne samne kisi cheez se mashghool hue. Phir Abu Usaid ne apne bete ka hukm diya aur wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki raan se uthaya gaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hoshiyar hue. To Aap ne farmaya: Bachcha kahan hai? To Abu Usaid ne kaha: Hum ne use pher diya Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Us ka naam kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Falan. Aap ne farmaya: Lekin us ka naam Mundhir rakho. Phir us din us ka naam Mundhir rakha."
"1390","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon mein sab se achhe akhlaq wale they. Aur mera ek bhai tha jise Abu Umair kaha jata tha. Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai wo doodh chhuda chuka tha. Aur jab Aap tashreef late to farmate: Ae Abu Umair! Nughair ne kya kiya? Nughar tha jis se wo khelta tha."
"1391","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ansar ki majlison mein se ek majlis mein tha jab Abu Musa aaye goya dare hue. Phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar se teen martaba ijazat mangi. Phir mujhe ijazat na mili. Phir main lauta. To unhon ne kaha: Tumhe kis ne roka? Main ne kaha: Main ne teen martaba ijazat mangi. Phir mujhe ijazat na mili. Phir main lauta. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi teen martaba ijazat mange aur use ijazat na mile to use chahiye ke laute. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum us par zaroor daleel qayam karoge. Kya tum mein se kisi ne use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai? To Ubayy bin Ka'b ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tumhare sath qaum mein sab se chhota hi khada hoga. Phir main qaum mein sab se chhota tha. Phir main us ke sath khada hua. Phir main ne Umar ko khabar di ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye farmaya."
"1392","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya us qarz mein jo mere walid par tha. Phir main ne darwaza khatkhataya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Main, main, goya Aap ne use na-pasand farmaya."
"1393","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darwaze ke surakh mein jhanka jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas kanghi thi jis se Wo apna sar khujate. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use dekha to farmaya: Agar main janta ke tum mera intezar karte ho to main us se tumhari dono aankhon mein marta. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ijazat to nazar ki wajah se banayi gayi hai."
"1394","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hujron mein se ek se jhanka. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ki taraf teer ya teeron se khade hue. Phir goya main Aap ko dekhta hun ke Wo shakhs ko maarne ke liye chhup kar chalte taake use chubhoyein."
"1395","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Agar tumhare ghar mein koi jhanke jabke tum ne use ijazat na di ho aur tum use kankari se maro aur us ki aankh phod do to tum par koi gunah nahi."
